           <li>24V PoE Adapter (24V DC @ 0.3A) Included</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>UniFi UAP-AC-M | High-Performance Mesh Wi-Fi 5 Access Point for Indoor &amp; Outdoor Use</b></h2><div>Compact, indoor/outdoor WiFi 5 AP with 4 spatial streams and optional external antenna support for directional coverage.</div><div>Seamless Mesh Wi-Fi Expansion with UniFi UAP-AC-M</div><div><br></div><div>The UniFi UAP-AC-M is a high-performance, dual-band 802.11ac Mesh Access Point, designed for indoor and outdoor Wi-Fi coverage. With 2×2 MIMO technology and speeds up to 1167 Mbps, this compact yet powerful access point ensures seamless connectivity across homes, offices, retail spaces, and large outdoor areas. It features two RP-SMA connectors for flexible antenna options, allowing you to customize coverage with either included omni-directional antennas or optional dual-band antennas.</div><div><br></div><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li>High-Speed Mesh Wi-Fi – 802.11ac dual-band with speeds up to 1167 Mbps (2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps | 5 GHz: 867 Mbps)</li><li>Powerful 2×2 MIMO Technology – Delivers fast, stable, and interference-free Wi-Fi</li><li>Flexible Deployment – Mount on walls, poles, or fast-mount brackets (all included)</li><li>Outdoor-Ready &amp; Durable – Designed to withstand harsh weather conditions (-30°C to 70°C)</li><li>Customizable Antenna Options – Features RP-SMA connectors for external antenna support</li><li>Enterprise-Grade Security – Supports WEP, WPA-PSK, WPA-Enterprise (WPA/WPA2, TKIP/AES)</li><li>Mesh Networking – Expands coverage effortlessly with UniFi Mesh Technology</li></ul><div><br></div><div><b style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 17px;\">Technical Specifications:</b></div><ul><li>Networking Interface: 1× Gigabit Ethernet (GbE) port</li><li>Wi-Fi Standard: 802.11a/b/g/n/ac</li><li>Max. Clients: 100+ devices</li><li>Coverage Area: 140 m² (1,500 ft²)</li><li>Power Supply: 24V Passive PoE (Gigabit PoE adapter included)</li><li>Power Consumption: 8.5W Max</li><li>Antenna Gain: 2.4 GHz: 3 dBi | 5 GHz: 4 dBi</li><li>Operating Temperature: -30°C to 70°C (-22°F to 158°F)</li><li>Certifications: CE, FCC, IC, UKCA</li></ul><div><br></div><h4><b>What’s in the Box?</b></h4><ul><li>1x UniFi UAP-AC-M Access Point</li><li>2x Dual-Band Omni Antennas</li><li>1x Gigabit PoE Adapter (24V, 0.5A)</li><li>1x Mounting Kit (Wall/Pole/Fast-Mount)</li></ul><div><br></div><h4><b>Why Choose UniFi UAP-AC-M?</b></h4><ul><li>Easy Management – Monitor and configure your network via the UniFi Network Application</li><li>Remote Firmware Updates – Upgrade your devices anywhere, anytime</li><li>Guest Wi-Fi &amp; Hotspot Customization – Control user access, privacy settings, and network traffic</li><li>Scalable Solution – Ideal for homes, businesses, and outdoor areas needing seamless, high-speed Wi-Fi</li></ul><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                    \n\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-6 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-reviews\">\n                <form class=\"form-horizontal\" id=\"form-review\">\n  <div id=\"review\"><p>There are no reviews for this product.</p> </div>\n  <h4>Write a review</h4>\n        <div class=\"form-group required\">\n      <label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\" for=\"input-name\">Your Name</label>\n      <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" value=\"\" id=\"in